    "description": "<p><strong>INVESTED WARDING</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 8; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp; <strong>Usage</strong> worn; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><em>A simple, silk sash adorned with embroidered mantras of inner peace.</em></p>\n<p>When invested, the Sash of Serenity grants a +1-dodge bonus to DB and a +2-resistance bonus to saving throws against fear effects. Once per day, you can enter a state of serenity for 1 minute, gaining advantage on one saving throw of your choice during that time.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> invested, +1 dodge DB; +2 resistance on saves against fear (automatic where the save's traits say so, offered otherwise). Its Use (once a day): for 1 minute, advantage on one save. Choose a kind (Fortitude, Reflex or Will) and it is taken on your next save of that kind, forced or not; choose any save, and it is offered on the saves you roll from the sheet and spent on the one you tick.</p>",
